learn about LLMs and prompt engineering, or connect with other AI practitioners.","event_count":4177,"hero_image_desktop_url":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/42/5719a861-c421-4624-a9dc-8b8b73e3cf57.png","icon_url":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/0z/c1143c0e-a2ab-4434-b82b-80b0ba3ec2f0.png","name":"AI","page_title":"AI Events","simple_icon_url":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/2g/4121b0fa-bd9e-4a50-ad85-cf0000b6d919.png","slug":"ai","social_image_url":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/c1/486065e1-2511-4577-a0e0-5eb683d38a3d.png","subscriber_count":99218,"tint_color":"#D96D9B"},{"api_id":"cat-crypto","description":"A complete guide to the most important crypto gatherings around the world. Join Ethereum and Solana hackathons, learn about zk and layer-2s, and immerse yourself in the world of web3.","event_count":734,"hero_image_desktop_url":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/vd/d2237ab2-c9d1-4ae2-8c14-1fd57585adf2.png","icon_url":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/yl/096bc517-f9fc-49fe-befd-401e29cc4662.png","name":"Crypto","page_title":"Crypto Events","simple_icon_url":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/6z/da7f11e1-86d8-44b5-8e0a-f8de5211225d.png","slug":"crypto","social_image_url":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/3e/968fad94-33c6-4d89-a635-9702bfcacca7.png","subscriber_count":38831,"tint_color":"#806AD6"}],"ticket_info":{"price":null,"is_free":true,"max_price":null,"is_sold_out":true,"spots_remaining":0,"is_near_capacity":false,"require_approval":false},"registration_availability":"waitlist","subscribed_to_calendar":false,"event_invite":null,"manager_info":null,"guest_info":null,"host_info":null,"sold_out":true,"locale":"zh","theme_meta":{"theme":"legacy"},"tint_color":"#7b6492","can_register_for_multiple_tickets":false,"font_title":"snpro","description_mirror":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"AI 工具經常聽到，但到底怎樣用在「投資」上面？","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"學得再多功能，如果最後不能夠變成你的資產，其實完全沒有用。而 AI 最能夠落地的地方，一定是投資。","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"以前一間機構要一隊人才做得到的研究，今日一個人加一部電腦就做得到。","type":"text"},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"hard_break"},{"text":"🎯 這一晚會講三件事","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"① 如何建立你的第一個 AI 員工","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"打造一個 ‘有記憶’ 的 AI ，24/7 隨時候命的私人員工。","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"② 如何解決 AI 有幻覺的問題","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"AI 最擅長的，是把不確定的事寫得好像很肯定。你不敢用它的結論去做決定，問題就在這裡。","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"解決這個問題，AI 的產出才算真的可以用——否則做得越快，錯得越快。","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"③ 了解完整 AI Full Investment Team 的能力","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"一個員工，其實只是開始。","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"最後我會給你看一支完整的 AI Investment Team：情報收集、深度研究、風險檢查各自分工。","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"你會看到差距在哪裡，也會知道由「一個員工」走到「一支團隊」，中間實際上需要什麼。","type":"text"},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"hard_break"},{"text":"​","type":"text"},{"text":"👤 適合邊個","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"hard_break"},{"text":"對 crypto / 投資有興趣、想學識用 AI 幫自己做判斷嘅你 —— 完全新手都歡迎。","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"費用：完全免費","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"時間：9月16號 晚上7點 - 9點","type":"text"},{"type":"hard_break"},{"type":"hard_break"},{"text":"（","type":"text"},{"text":"建議帶備個人","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":"電腦，方便一起實戰操作）","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"🎤 關於講者","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"hard_break"},{"text":"Matthew — CFA / FRM,前對沖基金投資總監, Chainlab 創辦人。","type":"text"}]}]},"eth_address_requirement":null,"faqs":null,"name_requirement":"full-name","phone_number_requirement":"required","solana_address_requirement":null,"registration_questions":[],"is_flagged":false,"is_managing_calendar_admin":false,"show_unlock_code_option":false,"has_multiple_ticket_types":false,"membership_tiers":[],"membership_info":null,"waitlist_active":true,"route":null,"featured_city":{"api_id":"discplace-z9B5Guglh2WINA1","slug":"hongkong","name":"Hong Kong"}}